  "description": "The Aml.Engine allows you to process AutomationML documents with a provided Application Programming Interface, based on .NET. Using the API you interact with CAEX-Elements and AutomationML-Objects. The Aml.Engine supports AutomationML documents based on CAEX2.15  as wells as documents, based on CAEX 3.0.",
